6. The presentation (pitch/presentacion/)
==========================================================================

NASA images in the slides: Curiosity Mastcam PIA26696
(NASA/JPL-Caltech/MSSS); HiRISE (NASA/JPL/University of Arizona, NASA
Mars Trek, USGS); Viking MDIM 2.1 (NASA/JPL/USGS).

