domain), data/astronaut.js; its place and size on the slide are
illustrative. No AI-generated imagery is used in the presentation.

The slides carry no screenshots: their 3D scenes are drawn from the
data above, and their numbers come from the app's rule ported to
JavaScript (walkback-model.js).

